    "message": "Move the paid live API tests to tests/live\n\ntests/integration will hold ordinary offline integration tests, so the\npaid tests move out and the API-key gate now opens only for\ntests/live/test_live_api.py. A test asserts the old path stays closed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
